{"task_id": "Mbpp/16", "solution": "def text_lowercase_underscore(input_string):\n    def is_empty_string(s):\n        return len(s) == 0\n\n    def is_lowercase_letter(char):\n        return 'a' <= char <= 'z'\n\n    def is_underscore(char):\n        return char == '_'\n\n    def validate_characters(s):\n        for char in s:\n            if not (is_lowercase_letter(char) or is_underscore(char)):\n                return False\n        return True\n\n    def check_underscore_placement(s):\n        if is_empty_string(s):\n            return True # This case is handled by the main function already\n        if s[0] == '_' or s[-1] == '_':\n            return False\n        return True\n\n    def check_consecutive_underscores(s):\n        for i in range(len(s) - 1):\n            if s[i] == '_' and s[i+1] == '_':\n                return False\n        return True\n\n    if is_empty_string(input_string):\n        return False\n\n    if not validate_characters(input_string):\n        return False\n\n    if not check_underscore_placement(input_string):\n        return False\n\n    if not check_consecutive_underscores(input_string):\n        return False\n\n    return True"}
