{"task_id": "Mbpp/68", "solution": "def is_Monotonic(array: list) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Check if the given array is monotonic (non-decreasing or non-increasing).\n\n    Args:\n        array: List of comparable elements\n\n    Returns:\n        bool: True if array is monotonic, False otherwise\n    \"\"\"\n    if len(array) <= 1:\n        return True\n\n    is_non_decreasing = True\n    is_non_increasing = True\n\n    for i in range(1, len(array)):\n        if array[i] < array[i - 1]:\n            is_non_decreasing = False\n        if array[i] > array[i - 1]:\n            is_non_increasing = False\n\n    return is_non_decreasing or is_non_increasing"}
