{"task_id": "Mbpp/120", "solution": "def max_product_tuple(tuple_list: list) -> float:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the maximum absolute product between numbers in pairs of tuples.\n    Calculates the absolute product for each tuple and returns the largest one.\n    \"\"\"\n    max_abs_product = 0.0\n\n    for num1, num2 in tuple_list:\n        current_product = num1 * num2\n        abs_current_product = abs(current_product)\n        if abs_current_product > max_abs_product:\n            max_abs_product = abs_current_product\n            \n    return max_abs_product"}
