{"task_id": "Mbpp/126", "solution": "def calculate_divisors(number: int) -> list[int]:\n    \"\"\"Calculates all divisors of a given number.\"\"\"\n    divs = []\n    for i in range(1, number + 1):\n        if number % i == 0:\n            divs.append(i)\n    return divs\ndef find_common_divisors(divisors1: list[int], divisors2: list[int]) -> list[int]:\n    \"\"\"Finds divisors common to two lists using set intersection.\"\"\"\n    return list(set(divisors1) & set(divisors2))\ndef sum(num1: int, num2: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the sum of common divisors of two given numbers.\n    It orchestrates divisor calculation and common divisor identification.\n    \"\"\"\n    divs1 = calculate_divisors(num1)\n    divs2 = calculate_divisors(num2)\n    common_divs = find_common_divisors(divs1, divs2)\n    return sum(common_divs)"}
