{"task_id": "Mbpp/172", "solution": "def count_occurance(input_string: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts non-overlapping occurrences of the substring 'std' in the given string.\n    \"\"\"\n    count = 0\n    pattern = \"std\"\n    pattern_len = len(pattern)\n    i = 0\n    while i <= len(input_string) - pattern_len:\n        if input_string[i:i + pattern_len] == pattern:\n            count += 1\n            i += pattern_len  # Move past the found occurrence\n        else:\n            i += 1  # Move to the next character\n    return count"}
