{"task_id": "Mbpp/264", "solution": "def dog_age(human_years: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates a dog's age in dog years based on human years.\n    Applies a common formula where the first two human years are 10.5 dog years each,\n    and subsequent human years are 4 dog years each.\n    \"\"\"\n    if human_years <= 0:\n        return 0\n    elif human_years <= 2:\n        return int(human_years * 10.5)\n    else:\n        return int(2 * 10.5 + (human_years - 2) * 4)"}
