{"task_id": "Mbpp/274", "solution": "def even_binomial_Coeff_Sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of even-indexed binomial coefficients C(n, k) for a given positive integer n.\n    This function explicitly sums C(n,k) for k = 0, 2, 4, ..., up to n.\n    \"\"\"\n\n    def _factorial(num: int) -> int:\n        \"\"\"Calculates the factorial of a non-negative integer.\"\"\"\n        res = 1\n        for i in range(1, num + 1):\n            res *= i\n        return res\n\n    def _calculate_binomial_coefficient(n_val: int, k_val: int) -> int:\n        \"\"\"Calculates C(n_val, k_val) using the factorial definition.\"\"\"\n        return _factorial(n_val) // (_factorial(k_val) * _factorial(n_val - k_val))\n\n    total_sum = 0\n    # Iterate through even indices k from 0 up to n (inclusive).\n    for k in range(0, n + 1, 2):\n        total_sum += _calculate_binomial_coefficient(n, k)\n\n    return total_sum"}
