{"task_id": "Mbpp/274", "solution": "def even_binomial_Coeff_Sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of even-indexed binomial coefficients for a given n.\n    This corresponds to C(n, 0) + C(n, 2) + C(n, 4) + ... up to C(n, k) where k <= n and k is even.\n    \"\"\"\n\n    # Helper function to calculate factorial\n    def _factorial(num):\n        if num == 0:\n            return 1\n        res = 1\n        for i in range(1, num + 1):\n            res *= i\n        return res\n\n    total_sum = 0\n    # Iterate through even indices k from 0 up to n (inclusive)\n    for k in range(0, n + 1, 2):\n        # Calculate binomial coefficient C(n, k) = n! / (k! * (n-k)!)\n        # Using integer division // to ensure an integer result\n        binomial_coeff = _factorial(n) // (_factorial(k) * _factorial(n - k))\n        total_sum += binomial_coeff\n\n    return total_sum"}
