{"task_id": "Mbpp/398", "solution": "def sum_of_digits(number_list):\n    \"\"\"\n    Computes the sum of digits for each number in a list and returns their total sum.\n    Handles negative numbers by processing their absolute value.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_sum_of_all_digits = 0\n    for number in number_list:\n        # Process each number to sum its digits\n        current_number = abs(number)\n        current_number_digit_sum = 0\n        \n        # Extract digits and accumulate their sum for the current number\n        while current_number > 0:\n            digit = current_number % 10\n            current_number_digit_sum += digit\n            current_number //= 10\n        \n        total_sum_of_all_digits += current_number_digit_sum\n        \n    return total_sum_of_all_digits"}
