{"task_id": "Mbpp/473", "solution": "def normalize_tuple(t: tuple) -> frozenset:\n    \"\"\"Converts a tuple to an order-independent frozenset representation.\"\"\"\n    return frozenset(t)\ndef _find_matches(list1: list, list2: list) -> set:\n    \"\"\"\n    Internal function to identify matching tuples based on normalized forms, returning tuples from list1.\n    \"\"\"\n    normalized_set2 = {normalize_tuple(t) for t in list2}\n    \n    intersection_result = set()\n    for t1 in list1:\n        normalized_t1 = normalize_tuple(t1)\n        if normalized_t1 in normalized_set2:\n            intersection_result.add(t1)\n    return intersection_result\ndef tuple_intersection(list1: list, list2: list) -> set:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the tuple intersection of elements irrespective of their order.\n    \"\"\"\n    return _find_matches(list1, list2)"}
