{"task_id": "Mbpp/579", "solution": "def find_dissimilar(tuple1: tuple, tuple2: tuple) -> tuple:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds elements present in either tuple but not in both, returning them as a sorted tuple.\n    Leverages set symmetric difference for efficient comparison.\n    \"\"\"\n    set1 = set(tuple1)\n    set2 = set(tuple2)\n    dissimilar_elements_set = set1.symmetric_difference(set2)\n    return tuple(sorted(list(dissimilar_elements_set)))"}
