{"task_id": "Mbpp/594", "solution": "def diff_even_odd(numbers):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the difference between the first even and first odd number in a list.\n    \"\"\"\n\n    def find_first_even(nums):\n        \"\"\"Helper to find the first even number in the list.\"\"\"\n        for num in nums:\n            if num % 2 == 0:\n                return num\n        # Assuming an even number will always be found based on problem context\n        return None \n\n    def find_first_odd(nums):\n        \"\"\"Helper to find the first odd number in the list.\"\"\"\n        for num in nums:\n            if num % 2 != 0:\n                return num\n        # Assuming an odd number will always be found based on problem context\n        return None\n\n    def calculate_difference(even_num, odd_num):\n        \"\"\"Helper to compute the difference between two numbers.\"\"\"\n        return even_num - odd_num\n\n    first_even = find_first_even(numbers)\n    first_odd = find_first_odd(numbers)\n    \n    return calculate_difference(first_even, first_odd)"}
