{"task_id": "Mbpp/630", "solution": "def get_coordinates(coordinate_tuple: tuple) -> list:\n    \"\"\"\n    Extracts all adjacent coordinates of the given coordinate tuple in a 3x3 grid.\n    Includes diagonal neighbors and the original coordinate, returned in row-major order.\n    \"\"\"\n    x, y = coordinate_tuple\n    adjacent_coords = []\n    for dx in range(-1, 2):\n        for dy in range(-1, 2):\n            adjacent_coords.append([x + dx, y + dy])\n    return adjacent_coords"}
