{"task_id": "Mbpp/638", "solution": "def wind_chill(velocity, temperature):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the wind chill index rounded to the nearest integer.\n    The formula uses wind velocity in km/h and temperature in Celsius.\n    \"\"\"\n    \n    # Calculate the wind chill index using the standard metric formula.\n    # WCI = 13.12 + 0.6215*T - 11.37*V^0.16 + 0.3965*T*V^0.16\n    v_power_0_16 = velocity ** 0.16\n    \n    wind_chill_index_float = (\n        13.12 \n        + 0.6215 * temperature \n        - 11.37 * v_power_0_16 \n        + 0.3965 * temperature * v_power_0_16\n    )\n    \n    # Round the calculated float value to the nearest integer.\n    return round(wind_chill_index_float)"}
