{"task_id": "Mbpp/745", "solution": "def divisible_by_digits(startnum: int, endnum: int) -> list[int]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds numbers within a given range that are divisible by every digit they contain.\n    Numbers containing the digit 0 are excluded to prevent division by zero.\n    \"\"\"\n\n    def _contains_zero(number: int) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"Checks if a number contains the digit 0.\"\"\"\n        return '0' in str(number)\n\n    def _extract_digits(number: int) -> list[int]:\n        \"\"\"Extracts individual digits from a number into a list.\"\"\"\n        return [int(d) for d in str(number)]\n\n    def _is_divisible_by_all_digits(number: int, digits: list[int]) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"Checks if a number is divisible by all its constituent digits.\"\"\"\n        for digit in digits:\n            if number % digit != 0:\n                return False\n        return True\n\n    result_list = []\n    for num in range(startnum, endnum + 1):\n        if not _contains_zero(num):\n            digits = _extract_digits(num)\n            if _is_divisible_by_all_digits(num, digits):\n                result_list.append(num)\n    return result_list"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/745", "solution": "def divisible_by_digits(startnum, endnum):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds numbers within a given range where every number is divisible by every digit it contains.\n    Numbers containing the digit 0 are excluded.\n    \"\"\"\n\n    def extract_digits(number):\n        \"\"\"Extracts individual digits from a number.\"\"\"\n        return [int(d) for d in str(number)]\n\n    def contains_zero(number):\n        \"\"\"Detects if a number contains the digit zero.\"\"\"\n        return 0 in extract_digits(number)\n\n    def is_divisible_by_all_digits(number):\n        \"\"\"Checks if a number is divisible by all its non-zero digits.\"\"\"\n        digits = extract_digits(number)\n        for digit in digits:\n            # According to the design, numbers with zero are already filtered out\n            # before this function is called, so digit will never be 0 here.\n            if number % digit != 0:\n                return False\n        return True\n\n    result = []\n    for num in range(startnum, endnum + 1):\n        if not contains_zero(num):\n            if is_divisible_by_all_digits(num):\n                result.append(num)\n    return result"}
