{"task_id": "Mbpp/797", "solution": "def _is_odd(number: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Check if number is odd.\"\"\"\n    return number % 2 != 0\ndef sum_in_range(l: int, r: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Find the sum of all odd natural numbers within the range l and r inclusive.\n    Natural numbers are positive integers (1, 2, 3, ...).\n    \"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    for num in range(l, r + 1):\n        if num >= 1 and _is_odd(num):\n            total_sum += num\n    return total_sum"}
