{"task_id": "Mbpp/809", "solution": "def check_smaller(tuple1: tuple, tuple2: tuple) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Check if each element of second tuple is smaller than its corresponding element in the first tuple.\n    Raises ValueError if tuples have different lengths.\n    \"\"\"\n    if len(tuple1) != len(tuple2):\n        raise ValueError(\"Tuples must have the same length for element-wise comparison.\")\n\n    for i in range(len(tuple1)):\n        if tuple2[i] >= tuple1[i]:\n            return False\n    return True"}
